{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_E767E7D2","title":"Finding Mila","entry":"Dlg_E767E7D2::entry","exit":"Dlg_E767E7D2::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_CF3C1B40","articyId":"72057774426569296","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mila Kalcifer","text":"Hey, whassup?","speakerId":"Ntt_B602CE34","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Hey, whassup?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":0.0,"y":-25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"27318","byteOffset":18215664,"byteLength":360}},{"id":"DFr_263D7EA7","articyId":"72057774426569317","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mila Kalcifer","text":"Yeah? Is this about Gideon?","speakerId":"Ntt_B602CE34","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Yeah? Is this about Gideon?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":600.0,"y":-25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37225","byteOffset":28424392,"byteLength":372}},{"id":"DFr_EE7DC2CD","articyId":"72057774426569332","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mila Kalcifer","text":"So you know what's really happening here, right?","speakerId":"Ntt_B602CE34","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"So you know what's really happening here, right?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1200.0,"y":-25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"35425","byteOffset":25761776,"byteLength":392}},{"id":"DFr_CC5664CA","articyId":"72057774426569353","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mila Kalcifer","text":"Gideon isn't after me for a bounty. He's my uncle.","speakerId":"Ntt_B602CE34","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Gideon isn't after me for a bounty. He's my uncle.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1800.0,"y":-25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"19510","byteOffset":15265768,"byteLength":396}},{"id":"DFr_015AFF1D","articyId":"72057774426569366","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mila Kalcifer","text":"I dunno. It's too awkward. I'd rather just skip it.","speakerId":"Ntt_B602CE34","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I dunno. It's too awkward. I'd rather just skip it.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":2700.0,"y":-25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"28840","byteOffset":18794256,"byteLength":432}},{"id":"DFr_78D39D01","articyId":"72057774426569372","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mila Kalcifer","text":"Did Gideon PAY you to find me?","speakerId":"Ntt_B602CE34","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Did Gideon PAY you to find me?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4200.0,"y":-25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"24575","byteOffset":17173352,"byteLength":340}},{"id":"DFr_B017D18E","articyId":"72057774426569388","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mila Kalcifer","text":"Sure sure. But you can't treat everyone the same, even when it comes to family. For example, I have an aunt who shelters kittens and bakes me cookies.","speakerId":"Ntt_B602CE34","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Sure sure. But you can't treat everyone the same, even when it comes to family. For example, I have an aunt who shelters kittens and bakes me cookies.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3300.0,"y":-150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"49576","byteOffset":33097040,"byteLength":460}},{"id":"DFr_464E0395","articyId":"72057774426569453","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mila Kalcifer","text":"Everyone can be dangerous, but you gotta give people a chance, and maybe he's not a great uncle, or a great person, but he's still mine.","speakerId":"Ntt_B602CE34","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Everyone can be dangerous, but you gotta give people a chance, and maybe he's not a great uncle, or a great person, but he's still mine.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3300.0,"y":100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30422","byteOffset":19389728,"byteLength":480}},{"id":"DFr_6AE72933","articyId":"72057821671316239","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mila Kalcifer","text":"Yeah. We don't get on. It's my birthday soon and he always takes me for a milkshake. I normally go along with it, but this year....","speakerId":"Ntt_B602CE34","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Yeah. We don't get on. It's my birthday soon and he always takes me for a milkshake. I normally go along with it, but this year....","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":2400.0,"y":-25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44745","byteOffset":31261232,"byteLength":440}},{"id":"DFr_B0366706","articyId":"72057821671316246","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mila Kalcifer","text":"Meanwhile Gideon is violent and insane, so if I see my aunt once a week, then Gideon once a year (or every two years) seems about right.","speakerId":"Ntt_B602CE34","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Meanwhile Gideon is violent and insane, so if I see my aunt once a week, then Gideon once a year (or every two years) seems about right.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3600.0,"y":-150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40574","byteOffset":29677920,"byteLength":480}},{"id":"DFr_82883878","articyId":"72057774426569303","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I'm here to warn you about something.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'm here to warn you about something.","TextSheVersion":"I'm here to warn you about something.","TextTheyVersion":"I'm here to warn you about something."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":300.0,"y":-150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"31119","byteOffset":19653920,"byteLength":320}},{"id":"DFr_D14309F4","articyId":"72057774426569309","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I was looking for you.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I was looking for you.","TextSheVersion":"I was looking for you.","TextTheyVersion":"I was looking for you."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":300.0,"y":100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20357","byteOffset":15585248,"byteLength":304}},{"id":"DFr_BCCD80DF","articyId":"72057774426569325","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"...Yes.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"...Yes.","TextSheVersion":"...Yes.","TextTheyVersion":"...Yes."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":900.0,"y":-150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22457","byteOffset":16380944,"byteLength":288}},{"id":"DFr_95C70484","articyId":"72057774426569339","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Gideon was hired to find you?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Gideon was hired to find you?","TextSheVersion":"Gideon was hired to find you?","TextTheyVersion":"Gideon was hired to find you?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1500.0,"y":-150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"52267","byteOffset":34187896,"byteLength":312}},{"id":"DFr_3F452559","articyId":"72057774426569346","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I don't.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I don't.","TextSheVersion":"I don't.","TextTheyVersion":"I don't."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1500.0,"y":100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43038","byteOffset":30612024,"byteLength":288}},{"id":"DFr_1FF16D2E","articyId":"72057774426569359","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"What?!","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What?!","TextSheVersion":"What?!","TextTheyVersion":"What?!"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2100.0,"y":-150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41043","byteOffset":29856072,"byteLength":288}},{"id":"DFr_3232D211","articyId":"72057774426569381","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"He's still family. That is important.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"He's still family. That is important.","TextSheVersion":"He's still family. That is important.","TextTheyVersion":"He's still family. That is important."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3000.0,"y":-150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"34959","byteOffset":25584744,"byteLength":344}},{"id":"DFr_EA7D6559","articyId":"72057774426569395","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"No.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"No.","TextSheVersion":"No.","TextTheyVersion":"No."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4500.0,"y":-25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21795","byteOffset":16135120,"byteLength":284}},{"id":"DFr_47024DA5","articyId":"72057774426569402","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Mila Kalcifer","text":"But I still appreciate the heads up. So what can I do for you?","speakerId":"Ntt_B602CE34","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"But I still appreciate the heads up. So what can I do for you?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":5100.0,"y":-25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"33282","byteOffset":20475088,"byteLength":380}},{"id":"DFr_90ECCC92","articyId":"72057774426569409","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I need Gideon's help to stop a criminal mastermind called Razlo.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I need Gideon's help to stop a criminal mastermind called Razlo.","TextSheVersion":"I need Gideon's help to stop a criminal mastermind called Razlo.","TextTheyVersion":"I need Gideon's help to stop a criminal mastermind called Razlo."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":5400.0,"y":100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"35434","byteOffset":25765520,"byteLength":344}},{"id":"DFr_B0A572E8","articyId":"72057774426569415","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I need Gideon's help with... something.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I need Gideon's help with... something.","TextSheVersion":"I need Gideon's help with... something.","TextTheyVersion":"I need Gideon's help with... something."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":5400.0,"y":-150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"42973","byteOffset":30587672,"byteLength":320}},{"id":"DFr_72B08772","articyId":"72057774426569423","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Mila Kalcifer","text":"So if you tell Gideon where I am, you get a favor from him in return?","speakerId":"Ntt_B602CE34","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"So if you tell Gideon where I am, you get a favor from him in return?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":5700.0,"y":-25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"28967","byteOffset":18842016,"byteLength":352}},{"id":"DFr_675D08D1","articyId":"72057774426569431","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Your uncle?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Your uncle?","TextSheVersion":"Your uncle?","TextTheyVersion":"Your uncle?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2100.0,"y":100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"32672","byteOffset":20243696,"byteLength":292}},{"id":"DFr_8339DD94","articyId":"72057774426569439","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I need your help.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I need your help.","TextSheVersion":"I need your help.","TextTheyVersion":"I need your help."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3900.0,"y":-150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40992","byteOffset":29835280,"byteLength":300}},{"id":"DFr_C2845D34","articyId":"72057774426569445","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"He is dangerous. You should avoid him.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"He is dangerous. You should avoid him.","TextSheVersion":"He is dangerous. You should avoid him.","TextTheyVersion":"He is dangerous. You should avoid him."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3000.0,"y":100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43940","byteOffset":30957592,"byteLength":320}},{"id":"DFr_B6D2D713","articyId":"72057774426569463","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Yeah.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Yeah.","TextSheVersion":"Yeah.","TextTheyVersion":"Yeah."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":6000.0,"y":-25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41155","byteOffset":29897480,"byteLength":288}},{"id":"DFr_1CA1C900","articyId":"72057774426569470","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Mila Kalcifer","text":"Look... You came to me with this so... tell him I'll call him. And I will. I promise. He is my uncle after all. In a fucked up way, sending you shows how he cares, I guess.","speakerId":"Ntt_B602CE34","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Look... You came to me with this so... tell him I'll call him. And I will. I promise. He is my uncle after all. In a fucked up way, sending you shows how he cares, I guess.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":6300.0,"y":-50.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"33834","byteOffset":20683024,"byteLength":452}},{"id":"DFr_B0865B88","articyId":"72057774426569477","type":"choice","className":"D